summary: Validate writing CPU list to osnoise tracing file with at least 128 processors
description: |-
    regression check of https://issues.redhat.com/browse/RHEL-86520
    Dynamically generate full CPU list (0..nrcpus-1) and verify that it can
    be successfully written to /sys/kernel/tracing/osnoise/cpus. This test
    verifies kernel support for large cpulist parsing in osnoise tracing.
contact: Chang Yin <cyin@redhat.com>
test: bash ./runtest.sh
framework: shell
duration: 10m
